          "kicker": "WXV global series",
          "heading": "Italy Women secure emphatic victory over Japan in competition opening match",
          "body": "The Italy Women’s Rugby Team opened their WXV Global Series campaign with a dominant 55-21 win against Japan at Stadio Omero Tognon. The Azzurre established an early lead through Aura Muzzo and Alessandra Frangipani, before a second-half score from captain Vittoria Ostuni Minuzzi helped secure their highest-ever points tally against the Sakura XV. Despite a challenging start under new coach Toshizumi Kitagawa, Japan struggled to contain Italy's attack as the hosts maintained their momentum throughout the opening fixture."
        },
