          "kicker": "Six Nations expansion",
          "heading": "Tournament officials continue evaluating proposals for a Six Nations fixture stateside",
          "body": "The prospect of taking a Six Nations fixture to the United States remains an open storyline for competition organisers. While recent reports have indicated that World Rugby is actively floating plans for such a match, there has been no confirmation regarding a specific venue or participating nations. Although England have been identified in the press as unlikely to participate in a neutral-site game, no formal decisions have been finalised to resolve the long-term proposal since its emergence."
        },
