          "heading": "Dewi Lake and Jac Morgan named as Gloucester’s new leadership duo",
          "body": "Wales hooker Dewi Lake has been appointed captain of Gloucester for the upcoming season, with fellow international Jac Morgan confirmed as one of his vice-captains. The pair, who joined the club from Ospreys, were chosen following a selection process involving input from the entire playing group. Gloucester head coach George Skivington noted that it was \"important for us to wait\" before confirming the leadership team, citing Lake’s experience as a factor in his appointment to lead the side moving forward."
