          "kicker": "Sevens Success",
          "heading": "Argentina's Men and Women Secure Gold at South American Games",
          "body": "Argentina’s national sevens teams enjoyed a dominant campaign at the South American Games in Rosario, with both the men’s and women’s sides claiming gold medals. The men’s team secured their title with a 17–7 victory over Chile, while Las Yaguaretés completed an undefeated tournament by defeating Colombia 35–5. These results ensure both squads have successfully qualified for the 2027 Pan American Games, maintaining Argentina’s position as a leading force in regional rugby sevens."
