          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Springboks make 13 changes as André Esterhuizen captains side against Australia",
          "body": "Rassie Erasmus has opted for significant rotation, naming 13 changes to the Springboks starting XV for the Perth Test. Centre André Esterhuizen will captain the side in Siya Kolisi’s absence, partnering Canan Moodie in midfield. Only lock Eben Etzebeth and winger Ethan Hooker remain from the team that faced New Zealand. Despite the wholesale changes, the visitors have reverted to a traditional 5-3 bench split, with Erasmus aiming to balance the development of his depth with the physical demands of the match."
